                  "content": "08/08c 印品四角托：Photo Wrap 200→88 後 Corner BL/BR 座標忘了跟著改，還停在舊高度255算出的y234（掉到姓名欄位上，變成表單角托）。已改y122（=143−26+5，143是新印品高）。同一根因（印品變矮，角托座標沒重算）用機械檢查（TL(-5,-5)/TR(w-21,-5)/BL(-5,h-21)/BR(w-21,h-21)）逐張核對全部10個印品實例，另外抓到10/10深（N5修完後印品變矮）與AX3-10（下同）也有一樣的問題，已一併修正，見overflow.json「cross_check_all_10_print_corner_anchors」。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "E7Zng",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Dn3uk",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N5",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sVohU",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "10/10深：R3用Content clip:true height320把Diary Card整張切掉，這是切內容不是修遮蔽（reviewer抓到）。R4改法：不clip，改讓FAB淨空——Header→Filter、Filter→已移除揭露列兩處間距24→16（省16，不動唯一的44斷點）；Photo Wrap 220→184、Photo Print 268→232；Content內gap（PhotoPrint→DiaryCard）24→16；DiaryCard的Snippet縮成單行「今天在溜滑梯上玩得好開心。」（125→99，同時省27）。結果：Diary Card完整顯示於y576–675，FAB於y682–738，淨距7pt、0交集。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "g7zHk",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r4aj09",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · A2 scan3",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "e21Lo",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "R3的scan3腳本有bug，宣稱0但reviewer同方法重跑得6。R4重寫scan3為單一execute呼叫內完成（不再跨呼叫傳globalThis），並加resolveInstances:true。結果：10/10深的FAB×Snippet兩筆已因N5歸零；AX3-10的Dropdown×Content剩4筆（Caption/Icon/Meta/Snippet），如實列在overflow.json並分類為「下拉開啟時蓋住背景內容」的預期模態行為（同09c/10c的scrim疊Sheet Wrap同一類），不再宣稱是0——F10/F11原文點名要求為0的是「FAB×Snippet」與「Dropdown×Trigger」，兩者皆已確認0。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "N6Qrbm",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "A6uMu",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · C12",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kXbmp",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Handoff Notes（Zx8GJ節點）原文「Photo Print底620」「FAB×Snippet交集=0」與實際不符，已整段改寫為量到的數字（Photo Print y328–560、Diary Card y576–675、FAB y682–738，淨距7pt）並更正scan3的方法與分類，見上。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "wseZB",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vyQ4A",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · A1（09b）",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HzHKK",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "09b沿用08同一根因：Top的gap用$sp-block(24)均分，AvatarField自己的44padding-top被當成第4個章節斷點外還多疊了一次24，導致Footer被推到852折線外。改法與08一致：Top gap→0＋兩顆顯式spacer（16、15，非16是為了讓Footer剛好貼齊712不多不少1pt），frame 910→852。結果Save/Cancel兩顆按鈕都在852內（y686–746／y758–802）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "k5XoI",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "g3gpna",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N2",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RJdpC",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AX3-08／08-iPad仍是R3改版前的副標「之後隨時可以在家庭頁修改，現在不填也沒關係。」（4個變體只改了2個，AX3/iPad漏改）。已同步為「填好基本資料，就能開始記錄他的成長了。」，4個變體現在一致。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "T8drF",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dpy4T",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N3",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MM3wn",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "cmp/Tab Bar的Label用$fs-meta，在AX3主題下解析到約33pt／單行48pt高，元件原本64pt高＋22pt icon是為預設字級設計，AX3下icon溢出膠囊上緣4pt、label溢出下緣4pt，且label(99pt寬)比它的分段(85.8pt)寬，最左邊「時間軸」的label左緣穿出膠囊左邊界。改法只動AX3-10這一個實例（不動元件本身，10/10b/10深仍是預設字級不受影響）：4個Label改enabled:false、4個Icon放大到48×48（icon-lg AX3階），變成「只有icon」的AX3降級版本——這正是本票R2 Handoff Notes就寫好的既有解法（icon＋accessibilityLabel），這次真的做到稿面上而不只是文字承諾。SwiftUI實作時4個icon仍需搭配accessibilityLabel（時間軸/相簿/寶貝/設定），本稿的Pencil限制無法標註，寫在這裡供ios-dev對照。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "j185W",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hqGZI",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R4 · N4",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "J4iwm",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "AX3-10新增的Photo Print是Copy自「10」的c9EwP，連同已經算好的染料池opacity（.386/.255/.270/.180）一起複製過去，但AX3-10這張印品實際位置(24,331)與尺寸(345×359)跟「10」的(24,328,345,232)不同，opacity沒有重算。已用同一套lit()公式重算：TL.392 TR.258 BL.236 BR.155——與 reviewer 預測值逐位吻合。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
