        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "uJZgW",
          "name": "N Sheet vs 推入式：選 Sheet 的理由",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            34,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wtZsn",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "$print-ink",
              "content": "Sheet vs 推入式：選 Sheet 的理由",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "DGrKy",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dm6Ee",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#7A3B48",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "LS-133 R1",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LKNBi",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "$print-ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "依票文「依既有慣例擇一並記理由」：選 bottom sheet（iPhone/深色/AX3）＋置中卡片（iPad），不用推入式（push）。理由一：連結所在的歡迎頁（svedU／Yc4EC 等）是**未登入狀態**，此時 app 尚無 NavigationStack 深度可推入——push 需要一個既有的導覽容器，而歡迎頁本身就是根畫面。理由二：LS-152 08 EULA 同意頁（z042Yg）與既有多張確認/操作表（LS-142 16 上傳佇列 rTEGf、LS-152 03b 移除成員 yMNOt 等）已建立「法務／確認類內容用 sheet，不用 push」的慣例，本畫面延續同一語彙，使用者不會在「這是不是要離開目前畫面」上感到意外。理由三：sheet 天生自帶「向下滑動關閉」手勢與明顯的模態邊界（Scrim），比 push 更清楚傳達「這是附加參考資訊，看完關掉即可回到原本畫面」，符合長輩心智模型。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
